nebflow.agent.FreezeSilenceSpec:
  + provider failure freeze: ZERO upward notification (parent mailbox + parent ref), panel says needs-you-but-auto-recoverable, wake entry stays 0.688s
  + one wave of 6 provider-failure freezes: notification count = 0 and the quiet digest reads 6 1.633s
  + deterministic-defect freezes produce exactly ONE aggregated alert for the whole wave (and no repeat on the next tick) 0.875s
  + auto-resume: waits while no provider serves, then resumes the SAME session via UserInput (never RestartAgent) with zero notification 0.371s
  + auto-resume budget: capped attempts with growing gaps, and only an exhausted budget escalates to ONE alert 0.338s
  + flow-notify: an infrastructure-fault node failure is never reported upward, a deterministic one still is 0.004s
nebflow.actor.FreezeDisplaySpec:
  + 时间表冻结 = 系统等待：不需人、可自动恢复 0.002s
  + 错误退避族（5 个原因）= 自动恢复中：不需人、无按钮文案 0.0s
  + 循环检测 L2 = 需人介入：引擎不会自己好 0.001s
  + 长停的错误族（resumeAt 超过自动恢复时限）⇒ 按需人工呈现，不谎称自动重试 0.0s
  + 已升级到用户（escalateAt=0 终态）⇒ 无论哪族都需人决策 0.001s
  + 等待上级决策（escalateAt 未到期）不夺走族的自动性 0.001s
  + 线值判定：delegate-frozen:* 一律 needsHuman（行面给唤醒入口），provider 故障族额外标可自动恢复 0.001s
  + 线值判定：错误族线值 → auto，schedule → window，未知/空 → 需人工确认 0.0s
  + FreezeKind 线值双向稳定（前端 freezeState.js 逐字同值） 0.001s
  + 线包 frozen 帧带分类三字段（真实命中形态：loop ⇒ needs-human） 0.005s
  + 线包 frozen 帧：退避族 ⇒ auto-recovering + needsHuman=false 0.0s
  + 迁移日志正文格式（本次报障那条的逐字样例） 0.002s
